# datasets.pdl - the data-hq registry (2026-11-09, phase P0): what a dataset is allowed to be called and who may see its rows. DATA, read by `data_op list`.
# DATASET | id | path | kind | class | provider | note
#   path      relative to the house root (or absolute); a row covers that file or everything under that folder; the LONGEST matching row wins
#   kind      fixture | ledgerdir | csv | tsv | pdl | ledger (informative; the real kind is sniffed)
#   class     public | private. private rows never reach the AI side (plan section 7); a dataset with no row is classed by `data_op list` from its own data (a ledger with a human seat is private, pets only is public)
#             and, with no positive reason, PRIVATE (fail closed)
#   provider  the app folder (relative to the house root) whose game.pdl carries `GAME | export | ...`, or -
DATASET | fixtures         | &.hq-apps/data-hq/fixtures                         | fixture   | public  | -                | FIXTURES made by hand to prove sniff, stats and list; not game data
DATASET | teropoly-play    | @.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/games/deskopoly           | ledgerdir | private | @.apps/deskopoly | the owner's play inside the editor (a human sits at p1); harness games live in scratch folders and are classed by their own ledger
